# --- Generated artefacts -------------------------------------------------
# orbis ships no data. Everything below is rebuilt locally by `start.sh` /
# `start.bat` (or by the Pages workflow) so that a fresh clone never inherits
# somebody else's calendar snapshot.
data/calendar.json
assets/land-dots.json
assets/borders.json

